{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[This is a &quot;Living&quot; Treasury Where Gods and Demons Dance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Knock on Fate: The Guardian Pusher&quot;. You're not facing a cold machine, but a &quot;living&quot; physics world guarded by a mighty Asura statue. In the dim firelight and curling incense smoke, your every coin drop is a &quot;Knock on Fate&quot; of skill and luck, a challenge against mechanisms and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/61891ea961e705784de1a06ba005648c.avif?t=1762307548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras_big/61891ea961e705784de1a06ba005648c.avif?t=1762307548 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[The Power of Sacred Beasts at Your Command]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The [Four Symbols Array] at the vault's heart is where the power of ancient beasts converges. Land your precise parabolic shots at the right moment, and the beasts will open the path for you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Tiger's boon is a spin on the slot machine of fate, a high-stakes gamble for the [Dragon Orb].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Azure Dragon's gift is the patience to gather [Jades], only to finally awaken the all-consuming fury of the Vermilion Bird\u2014the [Frenzy Mode]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the most profound Black Tortoise guards the rarest miracle. When the [Blessing of the Black Tortoise] descends, the miracle becomes tangible, waiting for you to push it towards glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/1d899ace6dfcf6779e1608e60fe09610.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/1d899ace6dfcf6779e1608e60fe09610.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/1d899ace6dfcf6779e1608e60fe09610.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Beyond the Dragon Gate Lies Destiny]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fabled [Dragon Orb] finally falls before you, it is not the end, but merely the prologue. True destiny lies beyond the grand mechanical marvel of the [Dragon Trial]. You will witness every heart-stopping bounce on the [Wheel of Fate], or the ecstasy of finally hitting the Jackpot and triggering the &quot;Mountain Mover&quot;! True masters can even make multiple Dragon Orbs dance together in this gamble of fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/915cf0d8f70446f52cb67f0b0c858d0c.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/915cf0d8f70446f52cb67f0b0c858d0c.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/915cf0d8f70446f52cb67f0b0c858d0c.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Permanent Power from the Divine Works Treasury]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Knock on Fate&quot; is more than just pushing coins. Every &quot;Ticket&quot; you win is a cornerstone to make you stronger. In the [Divine Works Treasury], unlock various permanent ability upgrades: expand your coin capacity, accelerate resource regeneration, or even activate the [Dragon Gate] to orchestrate a perfect &quot;Dragon Orb hunt&quot;. Every game you play builds an indelible advantage for your next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/e5fdc3fdd64aa332f3092ea8fdc657b2.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/e5fdc3fdd64aa332f3092ea8fdc657b2.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/e5fdc3fdd64aa332f3092ea8fdc657b2.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Become the Master Collector of the Nine Realms]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the vault lie legendary artifacts spanning five millennia\u2014from the Sword of Goujian to the Houmuwu Ding. Collecting them all not only unlocks a higher coin capacity but also grants you a powerful permanent boost to your Fate's Favor. This isn't just collecting; it's reforging the glory of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/7766bc49a70ec42a6db981133c48bfd1.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/7766bc49a70ec42a6db981133c48bfd1.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/7766bc49a70ec42a6db981133c48bfd1.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towards that coin pusher piled high with treasures, make your &quot;Knock on Fate&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add &quot;Knock on Fate: The Guardian Pusher&quot; to your wishlist now and prepare to embark on this one-of-a-kind oriental fantasy treasure hunt!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4114590?t=1762307548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/cc5c2da08a87d0af06b023b928daf9ed3824eefc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762307548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/81f069772883bb49c5d6a4430726073df309bc7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762307548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/81f069772883bb49c5d6a4430726073df309bc7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762307548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[This is a &quot;Living&quot; Treasury Where Gods and Demons Dance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Knock on Fate: The Guardian Pusher&quot;. You're not facing a cold machine, but a &quot;living&quot; physics world guarded by a mighty Asura statue. In the dim firelight and curling incense smoke, your every coin drop is a &quot;Knock on Fate&quot; of skill and luck, a challenge against mechanisms and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/61891ea961e705784de1a06ba005648c.avif?t=1762307548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras_big/61891ea961e705784de1a06ba005648c.avif?t=1762307548 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[The Power of Sacred Beasts at Your Command]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The [Four Symbols Array] at the vault's heart is where the power of ancient beasts converges. Land your precise parabolic shots at the right moment, and the beasts will open the path for you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Tiger's boon is a spin on the slot machine of fate, a high-stakes gamble for the [Dragon Orb].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Azure Dragon's gift is the patience to gather [Jades], only to finally awaken the all-consuming fury of the Vermilion Bird\u2014the [Frenzy Mode]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the most profound Black Tortoise guards the rarest miracle. When the [Blessing of the Black Tortoise] descends, the miracle becomes tangible, waiting for you to push it towards glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/1d899ace6dfcf6779e1608e60fe09610.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/1d899ace6dfcf6779e1608e60fe09610.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/1d899ace6dfcf6779e1608e60fe09610.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Beyond the Dragon Gate Lies Destiny]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fabled [Dragon Orb] finally falls before you, it is not the end, but merely the prologue. True destiny lies beyond the grand mechanical marvel of the [Dragon Trial]. You will witness every heart-stopping bounce on the [Wheel of Fate], or the ecstasy of finally hitting the Jackpot and triggering the &quot;Mountain Mover&quot;! True masters can even make multiple Dragon Orbs dance together in this gamble of fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/915cf0d8f70446f52cb67f0b0c858d0c.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/915cf0d8f70446f52cb67f0b0c858d0c.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/915cf0d8f70446f52cb67f0b0c858d0c.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Permanent Power from the Divine Works Treasury]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Knock on Fate&quot; is more than just pushing coins. Every &quot;Ticket&quot; you win is a cornerstone to make you stronger. In the [Divine Works Treasury], unlock various permanent ability upgrades: expand your coin capacity, accelerate resource regeneration, or even activate the [Dragon Gate] to orchestrate a perfect &quot;Dragon Orb hunt&quot;. Every game you play builds an indelible advantage for your next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/e5fdc3fdd64aa332f3092ea8fdc657b2.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/e5fdc3fdd64aa332f3092ea8fdc657b2.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/e5fdc3fdd64aa332f3092ea8fdc657b2.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Become the Master Collector of the Nine Realms]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the vault lie legendary artifacts spanning five millennia\u2014from the Sword of Goujian to the Houmuwu Ding. Collecting them all not only unlocks a higher coin capacity but also grants you a powerful permanent boost to your Fate's Favor. This isn't just collecting; it's reforging the glory of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/7766bc49a70ec42a6db981133c48bfd1.poster.avif?t=1762307548\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/7766bc49a70ec42a6db981133c48bfd1.webm?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/7766bc49a70ec42a6db981133c48bfd1.mp4?t=1762307548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towards that coin pusher piled high with treasures, make your &quot;Knock on Fate&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add &quot;Knock on Fate: The Guardian Pusher&quot; to your wishlist now and prepare to embark on this one-of-a-kind oriental fantasy treasure hunt!</p>","developers":["\u521a\u6b63\u9762\u7684\u7ea2\u9886\u5dfe"],"